🟢 Basic
Convert a string to uppercase using upper().
Convert a string to lowercase using lower().
Capitalize the first character using capitalize().
Convert the first character of every word to uppercase using title().
Remove leading and trailing spaces using strip().
🟡 Searching & Checking
Find the position of "python" using find().
Count occurrences of "a" using count().
Check whether a string starts with "Hello" using startswith().
Check whether a string ends with ".com" using endswith().
Check whether a string contains only digits using isdigit().
Check whether a string contains only alphabets using isalpha().
Check whether a string contains only alphabets and numbers using isalnum().
🟠 Replace & Split
Replace all spaces with - using replace().
Replace "Java" with "Python" using replace().
Split a sentence into individual words using split().
Count the number of words in a sentence using split() and len().
Convert a list of words into a string using join().
